Subject: [PATCH 1337/3799] soh: rename func_80BA2218 ->
 ObjWarp2block_WaitForOcarina

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the first of the two ocarina sub-states: while the player is in range it flags them as near an ocarina actor and, once they start playing, opens free play and moves to the song check.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Warp2block/z_obj_warp2block.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
